**/.env
**/.env.*
**/config.yaml
**/data
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
**/coverage
*.png
*.md
!frontend/**/*.md
docs
demo
scripts
.claude
private
.github
